# HP39g+ D1.55 Stock launch through the original USB Connectivity Kit path.
# RECEIVE FROM has three entries on D1.55: IrDA, HP39/40 (Wire), Disk drive...
# Selecting Disk drive... enters "Preparing to get aplet"; USB/Kermit delivery
# then runs behind the host gate exactly like the UART-backed HP39gs/40gs path.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11600 capture receive-usb-disk
12100 tap enter
12800 capture usb-preparing
13500 host-gate

# Relative to Kermit EOF. Delivery completion and Stock install settling are
# distinct, so use sparse launch-only ENTER retries. The launcher cancels
# retries after the runtime publishes its phase word.
0 monitor 115000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter
